			"Message": "build(Wind): Generate production build artifacts (minified + no source maps)\n\nThis commit runs the production build process for the Wind Element, updating the build outputs in both `Target` and `Configuration` directories.\n\nKey changes:\n- **Minification**: All JavaScript files in `Target` (application logic) and `Configuration` (build config bundles) have been minified, reducing file sizes significantly.\n- **Source Map Removal**: All `.js.map` files have been deleted to strip debugging information for the production release.\n- **Tree Shaking**: Unused type definitions in `Target/Bootstrap/Types` have been removed or emptied.\n- **Type Updates**: TypeScript declaration maps (`.d.ts.map`) in `Target/Source` have been regenerated.\n\nThis aligns with the release/production workflow, optimizing the bundle size and removing debug artifacts.",
