			"Message": "chore(Wind): Update TODO markers to DEPRECATED/FUTURE terminology\n\nThis commit refines the labeling of pending work items in the Wind Element to provide clearer semantic meaning for maintainers.\n\nChanges include:\n- Updating `Bridge.ts` documentation from TODO to DEPRECATED status, indicating it is confirmed for removal in a future refactor\n- Renaming the pending work section in VscodeIntegration.md from \"TODO\" to \"DEPRECATED\"\n- Replacing TODO markers in Preload.ts with \"FUTURE\" to distinguish between items slated for implementation (MessageChannel, Tauri arch detection) versus items marked for removal\n\nThis aligns with CQ-11 through CQ-13 import optimization efforts by improving code clarity and reducing ambiguous TODO markers that may never be addressed.",
